{
  "high_level_description": "Shot on iPhone, an empty tidy consulting room in a small outpatient clinic on a quiet weekday morning, with a light wood desk anchored left, a window with sheer curtains spilling soft daylight from the right, and an examination couch along the back wall.",
  "compositional_deconstruction": {
    "background": "A small outpatient consulting room with pale sage-green painted walls meeting a pale oak laminate floor. A low-pile neutral grey rug sits between the desk and the couch. Soft natural daylight spills in from the right through sheer white curtains, wrapping the room evenly with gentle falloff into the corners. Neutral cool-toned white balance, accurate true colours, deep depth of field with everything in focus from foreground to background. A door frame is visible in the background along the left-rear wall.",
    "elements": [
      {
        "type": "obj",
        "desc": "Examination couch along the back wall, centered in the upper-middle of the frame. Dressed in a crisp fresh white paper sheet, neatly creased at the corners. A thin beige blanket is folded at the foot of the couch."
      },
      {
        "type": "obj",
        "desc": "Framed botanical print mounted on the sage-green wall directly above the examination couch. Thin pale wood frame around a simple green leaf illustration on cream paper."
      },
      {
        "type": "obj",
        "desc": "Small wall-mounted hand sanitizer dispenser beside the door frame in the background on the left-rear wall. White plastic rectangular unit with a clear reservoir showing pale liquid inside."
      },
      {
        "type": "obj",
        "desc": "Light wood desk against the left wall, occupying the lower-left quadrant. Pale oak finish with a clean flat top. On its surface: a closed silver laptop centered, a small white ceramic pen cup holding two pens, a folded paper appointment card, and a half-full glass of water."
      },
      {
        "type": "obj",
        "desc": "Pale oak chair tucked under the light wood desk on the left side of the frame. Simple modern design with a curved backrest and four straight legs, matching the second chair."
      },
      {
        "type": "obj",
        "desc": "Second pale oak chair matching the first, angled slightly outward toward the room as if recently vacated. Positioned just to the right of the desk, between the desk and the rug area."
      },
      {
        "type": "obj",
        "desc": "Tall window on the right wall with sheer white curtains diffusing the daylight. The curtains hang floor-to-ceiling, glowing softly from the light behind them."
      },
      {
        "type": "obj",
        "desc": "Leafy potted pothos on the windowsill at the right side of the frame. Terracotta pot with bright green heart-shaped leaves, several vines trailing down toward the floor along the curtain edge."
      },
      {
        "type": "obj",
        "desc": "Corner of an empty wooden stool slicing into the lower-right edge of the frame as a foreground crop. Pale oak wood matching the chairs, slightly out of focus due to proximity to the camera, only the top corner and one leg visible."
      }
    ]
  }
}
